<title>USA: General Nutrition sees year EPS up 22 pct.</title>
<headline>General Nutrition sees year EPS up 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Nutrition Cos said Thursday it expects to report earnings of $0.95 per share for the fiscal year ended February 1, up 22 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>The earnings exclude one-time charges of $91.2 million, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it expects a 17 percent jump in revenues, to about $991 million.</p>
<p>It said it will issue its earnings report March 13.</p>
</text>
